  "stakes": {
    "do": "Sell cattle direct at a worse price for better standing. Break the green colt that has already thrown two Calloway hands.",
    "lose": "Birdie's welcome at home, if Cole hears the wrong thing from you. A hand, if the colt wins.",
    "decide": "Whether to carry Birdie's word back to Hattie and Whit, or leave the family to it."
  },
  "art_gap": "Reads as the best-fenced field in the county, which is most of the point. Needs a ranch house, outbuildings, a windmill and a stock tank before it outranks the outfit's wagon camp on sight."
}
